DDIIAAGGNNOOSSTTIICCSS
     The ggeettiippnnooddeebbyynnaammee() and ggeettiippnnooddeebbyyaaddddrr() functions returns NULL on er‐
     rors.  The integer values pointed to by _e_r_r_o_r___n_u_m may then be checked to
     see whether this is a temporary failure or an invalid or unknown host.
     The meanings of each error code are described in gethostbyname(3).

